Package: PortinariColors
Type: Package
Title: Color Palettes Inspired by the Paintings of Candido Portinari
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Rafa", "Lopes", email = "lopes1313@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Color palettes inspired by paintings of Candido Portinari held by
    the Museu de Arte de Sao Paulo (MASP) and by his Guerra (War) and Paz
    (Peace) panels at the United Nations Headquarters. Provides qualitative,
    diverging and sequential palettes for discrete and continuous data,
    ready-made 'ggplot2' color and fill scales, and a colorblind-safety check
    that simulates protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia following Machado,
    Oliveira and Fernandes (2009) <https://doi.org/10.1109/tvcg.2009.113>.
